@startuml contract-state
title CrowdChainEscrow — Campaign State (on-chain)
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty description

[*] --> Active : createCampaign()\n[onlyOwner]

state Active {
  Active : donate() accepted until deadline
  Active : weekly: releaseStage() / markUnfunded()\n  per scheduled week
}

Active --> Funded : [project] donate() makes raised == goal
Active --> Funded : [project] finalize() after deadline,\nraised >= M1 (later stages may be Unfunded,\nleftover -> refundPool)
Active --> Refunding : [project] finalize() after deadline,\nraised < M1 (refundPool = raised)
Active --> Completed : [weekly] last week processed\n& no proof outstanding\n(leftover -> refundPool)
Active --> Cancelled : cancelCampaign()\n(refundPool = raised - released)

Funded --> Completed : last fundable stage released\n& recordProof()
Funded --> Cancelled : cancelCampaign()

Refunding --> [*]
Completed --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]

note bottom of Cancelled
  claimRefund() works in any state
  while the caller's share of
  refundPool is not yet fully paid.
end note
@enduml
